            "content": "<p><strong>Essence Oil:</strong> Dimethicone, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Dimethiconol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Squalane, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Rosa Rugosa Flower Oil, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Hexyldecanol.</p><p><strong>Trace ingredients:</strong> Jasminum Sambac (Jasmine) Flower Oil, Stearic Acid, N-Palmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Bisabolol, Laminaria Ochroleuca Extract, Brassica Campestris Sterols.</p><p><strong>Black Truffle Granules:</strong> Water, Butylene Glycol, Tremella Fuciformis (Snow Mushroom) Polysaccharide, 1,2-Hexanediol, 4-Hydroxyphenyl Ethanol, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Acrylates Crosspolymer, Polyacrylamide, C13-14 Isoparaffin.</p><p><strong>Trace ingredients:</strong> Collagen, Propylene Glycol, Tuber Melanosporum (Black Truffle) Extract, Laureth-7, Silica, Malachite Extract, 1,2-Pentanediol, Phellodendron Amurense Bark Extract, CI 16035.</p>"
